  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252freggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_b0add901-8e9e-4418-845f-1e65c3f72df1.png\" width=\"762\" height=\"254\"></strong></span></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>感謝我們的贊助商</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>感謝 ZAP-HOSTING！使用優惠碼 Reggarf-1047，即可享受全訂單 8 折優惠！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_d346f672-075e-4fc3-b6b0-de2af7552b81.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-better-motors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/PzouXFuY?color=34D058&label=Modrinth Downloads&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-motors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1162812?color=FC7303&label=CurseForge Downloads&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Reggarfgod/Create_Better_Motors/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Reggarfgod/Create_Better_Motors?color=6E40C9&label=Issues&logo=github\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JBZxyKNNmY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1188575775776051232?color=5865F2&label=Online Users&logo=discord\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Create：更優質馬達</strong></span></h1>\n<p>用 <strong>Create：更優質馬達</strong> 為你的 Minecraft 世界注入強大動力！本模組引入了 7 款強力馬達，能無縫將 <strong>Forge 能量 (<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">FE</span>)</strong> 轉換為 <strong>應力單位 (<span style=\"color:#3598db\">SU</span>)</strong>，為你的機械裝置帶來全新可能性。</p>\n<p>主要特色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>高效馬達</strong></span>：透過 7 款專為優化效能設計的專用馬達，將 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">FE</span> 轉換為 <span style=\"color:#3598db\">SU</span>。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>高輸出發電機</strong></span>：輸入 SU 最高可產生 <strong>452 FE/t</strong>，非常適合耗電量高的裝置配置。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>完全可設定</strong></span>：提供自訂設定選項，讓你根據需求調整馬達與發電機，確保與任何建築或遊玩風格完美相容。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>Reggarfonite 礦石</strong></span>：生成於 Y 層級 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">-64</span> 至 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">64</span> 之間。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_688e3c35-b99c-416a-9459-306b6c43f611.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"1277\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_4ea1f30f-9788-44ea-b927-e71851f8eacd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"762\" height=\"1354\"></p>",
